            "场强与电荷：$E = U/d = 300 \\div 5.00\\times10^{-3} = 6.00\\times10^{4}\\ \\text{V/m}$；$q = \\dfrac{mg(v_d+v_u)}{E v_d} = \\dfrac{5.05\\times10^{-15}\\times(1+4.75)}{6.00\\times10^{4}} = \\dfrac{5.05\\times10^{-15}\\times5.75}{6.00\\times10^{4}} = 4.84\\times10^{-19}\\ \\text{C}$。",
